格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Codex and agent skills for Cregh.","id":"gh:1270079000","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"skills","slug":"creght-dev/skills","topics":["agent-website","ai-website-builder","creght","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Codex and agent skills for Cregh."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Creght Skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"This repository provides Codex/agent skills for Creght. They help agents understand Creght project s"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"tructure, CLI workflows, page development conventions, CMS/Form/Auth/Func backend/SEO features, and "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"other platform capabilities."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Skills"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **`creght`** — the base platform skill: CLI workflows, pages/components conventions, CMS, forms, A"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"uth, Func backend, SEO, publishing.\n- **`site-replica`** — replicate any existing website onto Cregh"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"t (\"复刻网站\"): probes the source in a real browser, audits every animation and interaction, rebuilds it"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" as an original React/Tailwind implementation with license-safe placeholder assets, then verifies de"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"sktop + mobile against the source in a loop until parity. Builds on top of `creght`."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What This Skill Does"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Guides agents through Creght CLI workflows for creating projects, pulling workspace files, pushing"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" frontend and Func backend file changes, resolving merge conflicts, previewing, and publishing sites"},{"id":"p7s3","text":".\n- Discovers project and site IDs from rendered Creght page URLs through `/.well-known/creght.json`"},{"id":"p7s4","text":".\n- Enforces Creght page development conventions, such as `/pages` routes, the `/components` directo"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ry, native `<a>` navigation, and `getServerSideProps` for data loading.\n- Helps write React + Tailwi"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"nd v4 pages and components that follow Creght platform requirements.\n- Provides implementation refer"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ences for common platform capabilities such as CMS, form submissions, Auth, file-based Func backend "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"code under `backend/func`, SEO metadata, sitemaps, and carousel components.\n- Helps debug local-to-p"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"latform sync, preview, and publishing issues."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Examples"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Install with `npx`:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Or use `bunx`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"After installation, supported Codex/agent environments will automatically load the corresponding ski"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ll guidance when working with Creght projects."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This repository is also a dsh bundle, so it installs into a dsh profile directly (requires `pnpm` on"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"sitory is also a dsh bundle, so it installs into a dsh profile directly (requires `pnpm` on `PATH`):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Pin a tag or commit with `github:creght-dev/skills#v1.0.0`. Remove it with `... plugin --profile web"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" remove creght-skills`, update with `... plugin --profile web update creght-skills`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Update"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Update to the latest version with `npx`:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Or use `bunx`:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Re-running the add command above also works — it is idempotent and pulls the latest."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
